{
  "_doc": "Declarative description of the footage scenes; tools/build_scenes.mjs turns each one into compositions/<id>.html. panels[].camera moves a virtual camera inside the capture: `to` is [cx, cy, scale] where cx/cy is the capture pixel put in the middle of the 1140x800 panel (the desktop captures are 1280 CSS px at 1.5x, so a CSS coordinate is 1.5x here). `at` is either a number of scene seconds or {cue: n} to land on a real narration cue. Speed labels are NOT listed here: build_scenes reads them from data/footage_map.json so the on-screen label always matches the actual edit.",
